- agent: agent-c
- branch: agent/c/m4-w4-sdk
- task: TASK-065
- summary: |
    Wired Federate.register_object_instance and Federate.update_attributes.
    register_object_instance records the call and returns the canned
    response when present (lets tests pin handles), otherwise allocates
    a fresh monotonic handle from the transport. update_attributes
    records federate handle, object handle, a defensive copy of the
    value dict, and the optional timestamp (None = receive-order,
    non-None = TSO). DiscoverObjectInstance event delivery rides on
    Federate.events() which lands in TASK-067.
- acceptance:
    - pytest pysdk/tests/spec/m4/test_spec_m4_object.py: 3/3 GREEN
      (after TASK-067 — at this commit 2/3 green; the discover_object
      test depends on Federate.events())
    - mypy --strict pysdk: clean
    - ruff check pysdk: clean
